// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004A3FAA size=102 name=?xfer@Rva004A3F8B@@MAEXPAVXfer@@@Z evidence=?:placeholder tier=B hypothesis:K
void HijackerUpdate::xfer(Xfer *xfer)
{
	UpdateModule::xfer(xfer);
	if (!xfer->IsLightCRC())
	{
		xfer->Version1();
		XferObjectID(xfer, &m_targetID);
		*xfer == m_ejectPos;
		*xfer == m_update;
		*xfer == m_isInVehicle;
		*xfer == m_wasTargetAirborne;
	}
}

